# 基础词 Unit23
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2023红宝书考研英语词汇-基础词
# 描述: 基础词Unit23核心词汇

{{garden}}{/ˈɡɑːrdn/}}n. 花园；菜园}}{{She grows roses and vegetables in her garden.}}
{{gas}}{/ɡæs/}}n. 气体；汽油}}{{Natural gas is used for heating and cooking.}}
{{gate}}{/ɡeɪt/}}n. 大门；登机口}}{{The flight gate has been changed to B12.}}
{{gather}}{/ˈɡæðər/}}v. 聚集；收集}}{{The students gathered in the auditorium for the assembly.}}
{{gay}}{/ɡeɪ/}}adj. 快乐的；同性恋的}}{{The gay festival attracted visitors from all over the world.}}
{{gaze}}{/ɡeɪz/}}v./n. 凝视；注视}}{{She gazed out the window at the falling snow.}}
{{gender}}{/ˈdʒendər/}}n. 性别}}{{Gender equality is an important social issue.}}
{{general}}{/ˈdʒenrəl/}}adj. 一般的；总的；n. 将军}}{{The general public was unaware of the changes.}}
{{generate}}{/ˈdʒenəreɪt/}}v. 产生；引起}}{{Wind turbines generate clean electricity.}}
{{generation}}{/ˌdʒenəˈreɪʃn/}}n. 一代人；产生}}{{The younger generation is more open to new ideas.}}
{{generous}}{/ˈdʒenərəs/}}adj. 慷慨的；大方的}}{{She is very generous with her time and resources.}}
{{genius}}{/ˈdʒiːniəs/}}n. 天才；天赋}}{{Einstein was a genius who changed the world of physics.}}
{{gentle}}{/ˈdʒentl/}}adj. 温柔的；温和的}}{{She has a gentle way of speaking to children.}}
{{genuine}}{/ˈdʒenjuɪn/}}adj. 真正的；真诚的}}{{His concern for others is genuine.}}
{{gesture}}{/ˈdʒestʃər/}}n. 手势；姿态；v. 做手势}}{{He made a gesture of welcome with his hand.}}
{{get}}{/ɡet/}}v. 得到；变得；到达}}{{I got a new job offer last week.}}
{{giant}}{/ˈdʒaɪənt/}}n. 巨人；adj. 巨大的}}{{The technology company is a giant in the industry.}}
{{gift}}{/ɡɪft/}}n. 礼物；天赋}}{{She has a gift for understanding complex problems.}}
{{girl}}{/ɡɜːrl/}}n. 女孩；姑娘}}{{The girl won first place in the science competition.}}
{{give}}{/ɡɪv/}}v. 给；提供；赠送}}{{He gave me a book as a birthday present.}}
{{glad}}{/ɡlæd/}}adj. 高兴的；乐意的}}{{I am glad to hear that you got the promotion.}}
{{glance}}{/ɡlɑːns/}}n./v. 一瞥；扫视}}{{She took a quick glance at her watch.}}
{{global}}{/ˈɡləʊbl/}}adj. 全球的；全面的}}{{Global warming is a major environmental concern.}}
{{glory}}{/ˈɡlɔːri/}}n. 光荣；荣耀}}{{The athlete achieved glory at the Olympic Games.}}
{{go}}{/ɡəʊ/}}v. 去；进行；n. 尝试}}{{Let's go to the park for a walk.}}
{{goal}}{/ɡəʊl/}}n. 目标；球门}}{{Her goal is to become a professional dancer.}}
{{god}}{/ɡɒd/}}n. 神；上帝}}{{Many people pray to God for guidance.}}
{{gold}}{/ɡəʊld/}}n. 金；adj. 金色的}}{{She won a gold medal at the Olympic Games.}}
{{good}}{/ɡʊd/}}adj. 好的；n. 好处}}{{This is a good opportunity to learn new skills.}}
{{goods}}{/ɡʊdz/}}n. 商品；货物}}{{The store sells a wide variety of goods.}}
{{government}}{/ˈɡʌvərnmənt/}}n. 政府；政体}}{{The government announced new environmental policies.}}
{{grab}}{/ɡræb/}}v. 抓取；攫取}}{{He grabbed his bag and ran out the door.}}
{{grace}}{/ɡreɪs/}}n. 优雅；恩惠}}{{The dancer moved with incredible grace and elegance.}}
{{grade}}{/ɡreɪd/}}n. 等级；成绩；年级}}{{She received an A grade on her final exam.}}
{{gradually}}{/ˈɡrædʒuəli/}}adv. 逐渐地}}{{The situation is gradually improving after the crisis.}}
{{graduate}}{/ˈɡrædʒueɪt/}}v. 毕业；n. 毕业生}}{{She graduated from university with honors last year.}}
{{grain}}{/ɡreɪn/}}n. 谷物；颗粒}}{{Rice and wheat are the main grain crops in China.}}
{{grand}}{/ɡrænd/}}adj. 宏大的；壮丽的}}{{The grand hotel overlooks the beautiful bay.}}
{{grant}}{/ɡrɑːnt/}}v. 授予；n. 拨款；助学金}}{{The university granted her a full scholarship.}}
{{grass}}{/ɡrɑːs/}}n. 草；草地}}{{The children played on the grass in the park.}}
